OL,3,GNEWSAAerospace workers set to strike
OL,4,Aover pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 200 workers at a Leicester-based
OL,7,Faerospace firm are set to take
OL,8,Fcontinuous strike action in a pay
OL,9,Fdispute.
OL,11,FMembers of trade union Unite, who are
OL,12,Femployed at SPS Technologies Ltd, have
OL,13,Fturned down a two-year pay offer of 4%
OL,14,Fthis year and another 4% next year,
OL,15,Fwhich the union says is because "they
OL,16,Fdon't believe this goes far enough to
OL,17,Faddress years of low pay offers".
OL,19,FThe union said it was the third
OL,20,Fconsecutive year its members had
OL,21,Fballoted for industrial action, with
OL,22,Fstrikes beginning from Friday.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
